  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Close to all the action along 30A, but tucked away in the peaceful neighborhood of Grande Pointe. Just half a mile to the pristine sands and turquoise waters of Inlet Beach! Amenities include three porches... a chef's kitchen... a picturesque neighborhood pool and dock... and tons of restaurants nearby. <br><br>Adventurers will want to ride the beach cruisers (4 provided) to the beach, Camp Helen nature trails, or along the scenic path to Rosemary and Alyss Beaches. Rent a SUP or kayak and explore Powell Lake. Hang out at the beautiful community pool. And of course the amazing gulf is always an option - try out the two boogey boards or relax in a beach chair (beach chairs, small beach umbrellas and beach towels are included). The outdoor shower makes cleaning up a breeze. <br> <br>Inside, enjoy a movie on the 65\" TV - Netflix, HBO Max and Hulu are provided. The master suite features a comfy king bed, TV, desk, and a screened porch that's the perfect place for morning coffee. The second bedroom also boasts a plush king bed and TV. The third bedroom has two sets of bunk beds and a TV. A full-size washer and dryer are available for your use. The house was built in 2018, with the light, bright feel and open spaces we love with new construction.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Perfect beach getaway! Bike to beach, pool - 4 cruisers included!"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
