            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Hello Adiene, I'm so glad you enjoyed the house and had a relaxing stay. Please do come back anytime!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "The house was perfect! Diane was so helpful and responsive! Everything we needed and so relaxing to come home to after a day at the beach. The location was quiet and outside the craziness of spring breakers but still close enough to get to beach and restaurants easily. We will definitely be back!",
