          {
            "date": "Jul 10, 2023",
            "id": "9127c842-736e-4c8b-8c56-212866fc0a41",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Hi Adam, we're so glad you chose to stay at our house, and you all are welcome back anytime!!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "We had a great time on our family vacation. The owner was very accommodating and was quick to respond to any questions I had. The home was clean, roomy, relaxing, and well equipped. Coffee pot made good hot coffee and the beds allowed us to rest well! Would love to come back!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Spacious",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Christy S.",
        "date": "2024-04-16T15:20:17Z",
        "id": "661e973434c3ad3a88b93e4c",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Overall this house was great and plenty of room for our family of 5. The first floor was spacious and comfortable. Great kitchen. We appreciated having a few staples there like coffee filters. We also appreciated the beach gear we could borrow. It would be a long walk to the beach with our little ones and beach gear but was a quick drive. Also pretty close (about a mile) from cute area of Rosemary Beach.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Family spring break vaca",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Jennifer M.",
        "date": "2022-07-03T00:27:23Z",
        "id": "62c0e26c848a5007faac00f9",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Jul 6, 2022",
            "id": "d1c530dc-728f-4a43-b326-7b69ff3f33bb",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Hi Jennifer, it was a pleasure hosting you and your family. We’re so glad you enjoyed your vacation, and hope you return soon!! Take care.",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
